# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Submit two consecutive OptionalAction responses through the native client.
# Forcing: Two Reconnaissance Mission permanents each trigger when Faerie Miscreant deals combat damage.
# AI behavior: The opponent has no blockers or relevant actions, so every decision belongs to the human seat.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = Both triggers are accepted and exactly two cards are drawn.
#   LOSE = Either response is lost or the draw result is wrong.
#   TIMEOUT = Either optional prompt cannot submit or the second prompt never becomes actionable.
# Card roles:
#   Reconnaissance Mission — Arena-native source of the same scalar OptionalActionMessage/Resp rail.
#   Faerie Miscreant — unblocked flying attacker that creates both optional triggers at once.
#   Island — known top card drawn by the accepted trigger.
# Protocol path: Combat damage followed by two ordered OptionalActionMessage/Resp exchanges.
# Paired with: kederekt-consecutive-optional-actions.pzl

[metadata]
Name:Native Consecutive Optional Actions
Goal:Win
Turns:10
Difficulty:Tutorial
Description:Attack with Faerie Miscreant and accept both Reconnaissance Mission triggers.

